    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513850/extras/24e7b428b8ffc7d96fbc3780f60db0ab.avif?t=1707198167\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience an Apocalyptic Zombie Outbreak</strong></h2><br>A zombie outbreak in a city has become exceptionally severe. <br><br>Survive for as long as you can using different weapons in the various different districts in the city until you succumb to the unending horde of zombies.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><br><strong>Survival</strong>: Survival gameplay consists of selecting the map of your choice and shooting your way through a horde of different zombies. As you progress through the different rounds you will notice each round gets progressively more difficult. You will notice that different types of zombies will start to appear as you reach the higher rounds in survival. These unique types of zombies will have their own unique abilities which will increase the challenge you face while attempting to survive in this apocalyptic city.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Use up to three different weapons to fight against hostile zombies</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513850/extras/ceafe28a8ebc9ca9977e7d1a1e007a1e.poster.avif?t=1707198167\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513850/extras/ceafe28a8ebc9ca9977e7d1a1e007a1e.webm?t=1707198167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513850/extras/ceafe28a8ebc9ca9977e7d1a1e007a1e.mp4?t=1707198167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Fight over 5 different types of zombies</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513850/extras/1e5938ac7aef65cbfd84a595f7a0c8bd.poster.avif?t=1707198167\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513850/extras/1e5938ac7aef65cbfd84a595f7a0c8bd.webm?t=1707198167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513850/extras/1e5938ac7aef65cbfd84a595f7a0c8bd.mp4?t=1707198167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play on different maps in the city and survive against the zombies</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513850/extras/c053de603a0659a5b7fe2120ff8e5d8c.poster.avif?t=1707198167\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513850/extras/c053de603a0659a5b7fe2120ff8e5d8c.webm?t=1707198167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513850/extras/c053de603a0659a5b7fe2120ff8e5d8c.mp4?t=1707198167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
